silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_stage_n a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ConcreteAnchorStageNExample" .
silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_stage_n silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchorStageN', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, A nonnegative integer indexing recorded events; n=0 is the day the Cat anchor was first asserted, n=1 is the 2026-04-12 vet visit, n=2 is the 2026-04-19 microchip read, n=3 is the 2026-04-26 dietary card admission. Stages are not minutes; they are admitted-event indices.." .
